There's no real reason to post a YAAP for this ascension except for some
silly fruit-naming tricks and it being my 50th ascension on NAO, but
here it is anyway. :-)

This was a Rogue I was determined to use silver daggers with, but
unfortunately (if unsurprisingly) I didn't find any until the castle,
which had one at the back. I used two wishes on more, getting four that
way, and did a lot of polypiling of darts to eventually get four more.
Those I got to +7 and used for the rest of the game. Since I had several
poly wands and was able to charge them too, I gathered up the 40 kelp
fronds from Juiblex's level and took the opportunity to construct a bag
of ASCII art, something I'd been wanting to try for a while. :-) I did
see another three silver daggers randomly (and the total of four is
probably the most I've ever seen ramdomly-generated in a single game),
but nine seemed sufficient.

On dlvl 44 I found the deepest bones I've ever seen (my previous record
being some fairly epic farmer bones on Juiblex's level), Brocktoon
having apparently died to a cockatrice corpse in some manner. A
particular shame as he doesn't seem to have ascended yet, at least not
on NAO. Tons of loot of course, probably the most useful being the +5
T-shirt and speed boots, neither of which I'd seen and hadn't had the
spare wishes for after "wasting" them on silver daggers. I used his
magic lamp to wish for a final fruit after renaming it again, you might
spot that one below. :-)

